ApU: the A·U / U·A step (5'-AU-3' on both strands), 1EKA's GA/UC step vibration circuit
* examples/rna_vibration. Units: C in u, L in Angstrom/mdyn; f_c [Hz] x 8185.679725 = wavenumber [1/cm].
* Force field: AMBER RNA OL3 (Cornell et al. base terms, bsc0, OL3 chi) via OpenMM amber14/RNA.OL3.xml; starting geometry from PDB 1EKA (NMR, r(GAGUGCUC)2 with hydrogens, Chen et al. 2000); methyl cap at the glycosidic N: C1' as CM (type CT), H1' and two H replacing O4'/C2' (type H1, charge of H1'), CM charge sets the molecule neutral.
